	(descr "XS4, 2-pin JST-XH, 2.5 mm pitch, right-angle/corner variant - pads run along X so the cable exits downward off the board's bottom edge instead of straight up. Housing still overhangs the 6.5 mm board width same as the straight variant; only the two THT pins land here. Pad 1 = raw +185V in, pad 2 = switched return to SEC's MPSA42 collector.")
